    "message": "Add the Japanese step 3 design for the Rust port and update the 7-day timing\n\nAdd docs/rust-port/step3-design.md with the current decisions merged from\nthe P1 and P3 experiments, link it from docs/rust-port.md, and bring the\nsummary line of the 7-day timing to the latest quiet-machine measurement\n(122.8 s at 50c34df, with the fsync range noted).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
